    <item>
      <title>New video appears to show U.S. tomahawk missile hitting near school in Iran</title>
      <link>https://www.nbcnews.com/nightly-news/video/new-video-appears-to-show-u-s-tomahawk-missile-hitting-near-school-in-iran-259004997745</link>
      <description>Experts say new video geolocated and verified by NBC News appears to show a US tomahawk missile over the skies of Minab, Iran. The experts say it is another piece of evidence that it was an American missile that hit the Shajarah Tayyebeh school on February 28, killing more than 170 people. NBC News’ Molly Hunter reports.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nbcnews.com/nightly-news/video/new-video-appears-to-show-u-s-tomahawk-missile-hitting-near-school-in-iran-259004997745</guid>
