      <description>President Trump said the U.S. military operation is “very far” ahead of schedule, virtually wiping out the Iranian navy, air force, missile and drone launchers, as Iran installed hardliner Ayatollah Mojtaba Khamenei as its new supreme leader. NBC News’ Richard Engel reports.</description>
